{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54619","headline":"兵要望江南 占雨第八（京本列第二○十七首） 十七 · 易静","name":"兵要望江南 占雨第八（京本列第二○十七首） 十七","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"密云现，雨阵黑浓浓。\n蓦地拦前轰霹雳，天雷惊震拥（首本作「摊」，兹从辛本、川本）来攻，有雨不多分。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"易静","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54619.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54619","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}